text When I go outside, it's snowing.
text Quite a quaint thing.
text I wonder if it'll continue pouring down after this.
text I wonder if the snow'll have piled up tomorrow morning.
text Starting tomorrow, what should I do?
text Sunohara still hasn't come back.
text I wish he'd just come back already...
text How should I spend my final hours...?
text Now that the both of us have to find a job... Will we still be able to do stupid stuff...?
text I bet we can... We really were stupid, after all.
